<title>UK: Tradepoint to open an hour early on Friday.</title>
<headline>Tradepoint to open an hour early on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tradepoint Investment Exchange Plc said on Thursday it will open an hour earlier than usual tomorrow after the British election.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Tradepoint said it will open on Friday at 0530 GMT for a 0600 GMT start, rather than its usual 0630 GMT for 0700 GMT.</p>
<p>Tradepoint is the main rival to Britain's London Stock Exchange and offers investors a facility to trade electronically in over 900 British companies.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542-7717</p>
